```

It captures `elements` (from the first redraw) and `state`. On subsequent redraws, `elements` becomes stale! `updateBounds(state)` uses `s.dom.elements.wrap` — dynamic, no problem. `renderResized(state)` uses `s.dom.elements.board` — dynamic, no problem. But `if (elements.autoPieces) autoPieces.renderResized(state)` uses the *stale* `elements.autoPieces` element from the first redraw!

